<title>UK: SNOOKER-LATEST POSITIONS IN WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</title>
<headline>SNOOKER-LATEST POSITIONS IN WORLD CHAMPIONSHIP.</headline>
<dateline>SHEFFIELD, England 1997-04-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results and latest</p>
<p>positions in the best-of-19-frames first round of the world</p>
<p>professional snooker championship on Thursday</p>
<p>(prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Anthony Hamilton (England) beat 13-Jimmy White (England) 10-9</p>
<p>12-James Wattana (Thailand) leads Graeme Dott (Scotland) 6-3</p>
<p>Dominic Dale (Wales) leads 15-Tony Drago (Malta) 5-4</p>
</text>
